{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>At the set time of which Elohim had spoken to him.</b> As the Targum renders: דִּי מַלִּיל יָתֵהּ — the set time that He had spoken and fixed, when He said to him ״לַמּוֹעֵד אָשׁוּב אֵלֶיךָ״ (there 18). He scored a line for him on the wall; He said to him: When the sun reaches this mark in the coming year, you will give birth."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:41.226313764Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}